{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"I'm home, </STYLE>Erina<STYLE ID="1">. Were you good, staying home by yourself?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Yeah!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"I see... </STYLE>You<STYLE ID="1">'re such a smart, good girl."</STYLE>
