{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Just... to a friend's place."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"I see... You were just gone all of a sudden. You surprised me... 
{PAUSE ""}
Hey, hey! I finally mastered Indian mathematics!
{PAUSE ""}
　Apparently the number zero was invented in India!
{PAUSE ""}
　And so―"<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Sorry, I want to be alone today."</STYLE>
