<BR>
"Huh...?
{PAUSE ""}
　O-oh, okay... For <STYLE ID="1">you</STYLE> to say that, it must be really bad... 
{PAUSE ""}
Oh, but next time you go out, tell me too, okay?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"But... today was for someone who died."</STYLE><PG>
"Someone died...? Was it a funeral?"
