<STYLE ID="2">"I said shut up!</STYLE>
{QUAKESTOP "500"}
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　Shut it, you've got nothing going for you but your brain!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　</STYLE>Your<STYLE ID="1"> face is the last thing I want to see!"</STYLE><PG>
"Uu... uuu..."
